# The ruling: "If The Master of Lake-town dies at the same time that a player loses life ... you choose the order for its two triggered
# abilities. If the mill effect resolves first, those cards - and also The Master of Lake-town - will be in graveyards before you
# determine how many cards to draw." Bot1's graveyard holds five (Black Lotus, Lightning Bolt and the three cards the Bolt at
# its own face milled). On turn 4 Bot2's Tyrox (4/1) is unblocked and Blade of the Sixth Pride (3/1) is blocked by the Master:
# Bot1 loses 4 life and the Master dies at once. Draw first: the graveyard has only six (the Master joined it), so nothing is drawn.
